  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Planning Mode Review**\n\nI\'ve just reviewed the `planning-mode` skill\'s details. I\'m focusing on the required workflow. Phase 1, Interactive Clarification & Interview (Turn 1), seems to hinge on calling `ask_question`. The plan is to start with 2\342\200\2234 targeted multiple-choice questions. I need to now delve into the intricacies of crafting those questions effectively.\n\n\n**Analyzing Design Requirements**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into the specifics. There seem to be some design choices and, potentially, areas of ambiguity. The user gave a detailed request that I can use as a base. It concerns an Android app feature called \"Ruang Karakter\" (\"Character Room\"), encompassing data, and screens that all tie together. The user gave a detailed description of the project, covering key aspects like data storage, styling, and design rules.\n\n\n"
