  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Customization Preferences**\n\nI\'m currently integrating character customization preferences into `UserDataRepository.kt`. I\'m starting with keys like `EQUIPPED_HAIR` (stringPreferencesKey) for hair and other features. This lays the groundwork for allowing users to personalize their in-game avatars. I\'ll need to define methods to handle the setting and retrieval of these preferences.\n\n\n**Defining Customization States**\n\nI\'ve defined new keys: `EQUIPPED_UNIFORM`, `EQUIPPED_HEADSET`, `BACKGROUND_ID`, and `ACCENT_COLOR`. I\'ve constructed a `Flow` and an update method for a `CharacterCustomizationState` that reads from the `DataStore`. This includes default values for each customizable attribute. I\'m now establishing how these attributes update in the flow for future use.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3351644442905447632"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add character customization preferences and methods to UserDataRepository\", \"EndLine\":110, \"Instruction\":\"Add character customization keys, flow, and update method\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"        val LEGACY_CODES_V1 = booleanPreferencesKey(\\\"legacy_node_codes_normalized_v1\\\")\\n        val CURRICULUM_FINGERPRINT = stringPreferencesKey(\\\"curriculum_seed_fingerprint\\\")\\n        val EQUIPPED_HAIR = stringPreferencesKey(\\\"equipped_hair\\\")\\n        val EQUIPPED_UNIFORM = stringPreferencesKey(\\\"equipped_uniform\\\")\\n        val EQUIPPED_HEADSET = stringPreferencesKey(\\\"equipped_headset\\\")\\n        val BACKGROUND_ID = stringPreferencesKey(\\\"background_id\\\")\\n        val ACCENT_COLOR = stringPreferencesKey(\\\"accent_color\\\")\\n    }\\n\\n    suspend fun normalizeLegacyNodeCodesIfNeeded() {\\n        val done = dataStore.data.first()[PreferencesKeys.LEGACY_CODES_V1] ?: false\\n        if (done) return\\n        database.normalizeLegacyNodeCodes()\\n        dataStore.edit { prefs ->\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.BOOKMARKED_NODES]?.let { current ->\\n                val mapped = LegacyNodeCodes.normalizeAll(current)\\n                if (mapped != current) prefs[PreferencesKeys.BOOKMARKED_NODES] = mapped\\n            }\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.LAST_VISITED_NODE_CODE]?.let { last ->\\n                val mapped = LegacyNodeCodes.normalize(last)\\n                if (mapped != last) prefs[PreferencesKeys.LAST_VISITED_NODE_CODE] = mapped\\n            }\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.LEGACY_CODES_V1] = true\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    val lastVisitedNodeCodeFlow: Flow<String?> = dataStore.data.map { preferences ->\\n        preferences[PreferencesKeys.LAST_VISITED_NODE_CODE]\\n    }\\n\\n    val userNameFlow: Flow<String> = dataStore.data.map { preferences ->\\n        preferences[PreferencesKeys.USER_NAME] ?: \\\"\\\"\\n    }\\n\\n    val userAvatarIdFlow: Flow<String> = dataStore.data.map { preferences ->\\n        preferences[PreferencesKeys.USER_AVATAR_ID] ?: \\\"radiografer_mri\\\"\\n    }\\n\\n    val characterCustomizationFlow: Flow<CharacterCustomizationState> = dataStore.data.map { prefs ->\\n        CharacterCustomizationState(\\n            avatarId = prefs[PreferencesKeys.USER_AVATAR_ID] ?: \\\"radiografer_mri\\\",\\n            equippedHair = prefs[PreferencesKeys.EQUIPPED_HAIR] ?: \\\"hair_default\\\",\\n            equippedUniform = prefs[PreferencesKeys.EQUIPPED_UNIFORM] ?: \\\"uniform_standard\\\",\\n            equippedHeadset = prefs[PreferencesKeys.EQUIPPED_HEADSET] ?: \\\"headset_none\\\",\\n            backgroundId = prefs[PreferencesKeys.BACKGROUND_ID] ?: \\\"bg_control_room\\\",\\n            accentColor = prefs[PreferencesKeys.ACCENT_COLOR] ?: \\\"cyan\\\"\\n        )\\n    }\\n\\n    suspend fun updateCharacterCustomization(state: CharacterCustomizationState) {\\n        dataStore.edit { prefs ->\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.USER_AVATAR_ID] = state.avatarId\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.EQUIPPED_HAIR] = state.equippedHair\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.EQUIPPED_UNIFORM] = state.equippedUniform\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.EQUIPPED_HEADSET] = state.equippedHeadset\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.BACKGROUND_ID] = state.backgroundId\\n            prefs[PreferencesKeys.ACCENT_COLOR] = state.accentColor\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    suspend fun updateUserName(name: String) {\\n        dataStore.edit { preferences ->\\n            preferences[PreferencesKeys.USER_NAME] = name\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    suspend fun updateUserAvatarId(avatarId: String) {\\n        dataStore.edit { preferences ->\\n            preferences[PreferencesKeys.USER_AVATAR_ID] = avatarId\\n        }\\n    }\", \"StartLine\":51, \"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/UserDataRepository.kt\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating UserDataRepository\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add character customization to UserDataRepository.kt\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\322\021\n\317\021\001i\024}\023:\3364[\025\363O\372\006q\001\030,\aJ\356V\212\360Z!7\023/\333\201_\221\005\257\273\320\020\214\303\261?\316e\205Df\331\276\\<\005\336t\367\261\227\242\004PF\022e\356pN\276\374\233\343@!\334k(\350i\212\206g\241)\215\201\201\371Fhw7i\a\324\230\334\347\340{\002\2432\3251\271\362\220G}\2375%\357X\027D\274 \302\327]\202\\\033\034\341\245T\022\373\332\261\263s\333\267A\374\b \246\034\350\321/\020\346/\017\242\376\231\216\245\231\026B\301\243\035@\304\344\3720\356>\342}|\032a\315\271\223\004\247H\021\275\261\275(\266\220\211\341\204\rG,l\030\302\337*v\350\360\r\304\225\377\245\330\037r\237\r\345\f\000\177\342\311\340\271\370N,P\263\352\216\207\367\301\036\331B\236\214\032\006)\002\037\321\033o\340o\v\313#\241\222\2276\037{\251$t\034\b\002\270\313Hlh/\302=\037z\276\341P]\000\275&&\254\234g]*}\365(\177\251Q\030t\211V\3476\016\356=R\265\256\"\220\215\325\375Mt\3160\201\311Z\233?Quuo\240\351\031\251\177g\017\251\325\003=\265p\273\241\304\\\036\201a^\321\376\275\242g\332u\210:5\342b\036Y(\021\0210>\217E\271\234\245\244%w\375\315\340\002\003\327\374\274:m\220>)\323L\230\023\026/\2212\276\325&wi\227*\260\330\0032\261$\361\3129\b\247\277\360\374\'\364\223\253.\376k\217%\227&\344\177c=\024\203g\252\303\331\264\221:\214\246t>\272\001\016\201\324\031\234\331l\325\370\370TR\024\366f,i\303\2441N\a\264\033\255\203\245\261\202XS\274xGzB\356\337\210\323\265\326\344|b\340\266{\217L\021\235\311\263\357DB\005\\?*GZ\274&E\024~_|2vS\t\265\314\0165\035\217\fh\370\342b\332g\247\3411\306\360\261g\315rc\237\370`\241\320T-3\202i\272\223NZ\226\233\227J#\235\000A\360mh^7\235#\026\237\377D\2426MKG\256\214\"\274H\232\031,t\230e\250\367w5+\316Cy\246\202\236+\364\365\035\254\006\323\254\213\215\035L\256:\243\320\203(\276}q\031kxb\032\352\204j1/\302\346\020h{\374C\315\177\034\345\307\357\363\006\030\307E\260\302\344JF`\250\357\031\366\333\035\202\332\033_W\035\b\"\327\305\312\\\311\300\353\215g\243\355\362z\242\177\037I\245F\362\027\t:r\'\313