  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Correcting Misnomers**\n\nI\'ve just been reviewing the discrepancies in naming conventions. I\'ve noted that `MedicalAvatar` utilizes the `label` property, not `name`. I found a similar error where `av.name` was being incorrectly used in `CharacterRoomScreen.kt`. Furthermore, `headsetItem` and `OrangeWarning` need correcting to `headsetItems` and `AmberWarning`, respectively.\n\n\n"
